(6239509, 923135, 122444, '<td valign="top">good composition. oversharpened. the muted colors took away the beauty of what i imagined a bursting explosion of orange and blue. topaz (or something like it) is a very effective tool to bring out details and blur out distracting elements in the bg, but it works againts you when overdone.</td>', 'good composition. oversharpened. the muted colors took away the beauty of what i imagined a bursting explosion of orange and blue. topaz (or something like it) is a very effective tool to bring out details and blur out distracting elements in the bg, but it works againts you when overdone.', '2010-12-01 00:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
