(6239702, 921515, 89940, '<td valign="top">A great portrait! Would have been much better without the umbrella reflection in the glasses. A soft box would have given a nicer reflection. 8</td>', 'A great portrait! Would have been much better without the umbrella reflection in the glasses. A soft box would have given a nicer reflection. 8', '2010-12-01 02:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239705, 922735, 89940, '<td valign="top">Would have been so much better if you hadn''t cut the foot off.</td>', 'Would have been so much better if you hadn''t cut the foot off.', '2010-12-01 02:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239742, 923206, 40391, '<td valign="top">Great capture and title :-)</td>', 'Great capture and title :-)', '2010-12-01 03:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239750, 920194, 40391, '<td valign="top">This image is beautiful and intriguing.  Im wondering what was used to light up the rocks and how you managed to capture so many stars without a star trail.  Its a bit of a pity that the shadows on the rocks are so hard but it doesnt take that much away from the overall effect.  Well done!</td>', 'This image is beautiful and intriguing.  Im wondering what was used to light up the rocks and how you managed to capture so many stars without a star trail.  Its a bit of a pity that the shadows on the rocks are so hard but it doesnt take that much away from the overall effect.  Well done!', '2010-12-01 04:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239755, 921874, 40391, '<td valign="top">What a lovely shot.  The colours on the rocks and contrasting fallen leaves are beautiful.  I would have preferred a slightly longer exposure to have more motion blur of the water.  Overall I quite like this.</td>', 'What a lovely shot.  The colours on the rocks and contrasting fallen leaves are beautiful.  I would have preferred a slightly longer exposure to have more motion blur of the water.  Overall I quite like this.', '2010-12-01 04:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239757, 922345, 40391, '<td valign="top">How adorable!  Her face to me seems a little overexposed, possible from a fill flash.  I wonder if converting to B&amp;W may have reduced the impact of this effect.</td>', 'How adorable!  Her face to me seems a little overexposed, possible from a fill flash.  I wonder if converting to B&W may have reduced the impact of this effect.', '2010-12-01 04:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239760, 922833, 40391, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic location!  I like the processing that has brought out such great colours and dramatic skies although it is bordering on being overdone IMO.  The boat is a nice addition that gives a good feeling of the size of this area.  Im looking forward to finding out where this place is.</td>', 'What a fantastic location!  I like the processing that has brought out such great colours and dramatic skies although it is bordering on being overdone IMO.  The boat is a nice addition that gives a good feeling of the size of this area.  Im looking forward to finding out where this place is.', '2010-12-01 04:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239762, 922336, 40391, '<td valign="top">Very strange tracks.  I hope youll let us know what created them.  I like the tilt used but feel this is missing something.  Perhaps converting to black and white and playing with the textures may have made this even more interesting?</td>', 'Very strange tracks.  I hope youll let us know what created them.  I like the tilt used but feel this is missing something.  Perhaps converting to black and white and playing with the textures may have made this even more interesting?', '2010-12-01 04:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239764, 922188, 40391, '<td valign="top">I am loving this photograph.  You got into the right place at the right time and had the talent to make the most of it.  Well done!</td>', 'I am loving this photograph.  You got into the right place at the right time and had the talent to make the most of it.  Well done!', '2010-12-01 04:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239772, 922341, 40391, '<td valign="top">Overall a lovely shot.  However, its the full moon that makes this image even more special.</td>', 'Overall a lovely shot.  However, its the full moon that makes this image even more special.', '2010-12-01 04:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239774, 922000, 40391, '<td valign="top">This is quite clever and very well shot.  Why wasnt this in the Orange challenge?  Or did you have an even better shot entered?  Well done!</td>', 'This is quite clever and very well shot.  Why wasnt this in the Orange challenge?  Or did you have an even better shot entered?  Well done!', '2010-12-01 04:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239775, 922105, 40391, '<td valign="top">I love the pink sky but would have loved a better exposure of that interesting chain.</td>', 'I love the pink sky but would have loved a better exposure of that interesting chain.', '2010-12-01 04:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239781, 922970, 40391, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured and I like the complementary red between the rider and barrier.  Somehow the bike and riders gear doesnt seem to be what I would expect for racing on dirt.  I wonder what sort of racing this is?</td>', 'Nicely captured and I like the complementary red between the rider and barrier.  Somehow the bike and riders gear doesnt seem to be what I would expect for racing on dirt.  I wonder what sort of racing this is?', '2010-12-01 04:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239783, 921731, 40391, '<td valign="top">Looks really cold.  I like the slight motion blur of the wave but I feel a slightly less exposure time may have been better to reduce the blowing out of the sky.  A sharper image of the wave may have created a more dramatic effect too.</td>', 'Looks really cold.  I like the slight motion blur of the wave but I feel a slightly less exposure time may have been better to reduce the blowing out of the sky.  A sharper image of the wave may have created a more dramatic effect too.', '2010-12-01 05:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239785, 922035, 40391, '<td valign="top">A proven good composure that I wish I had done when my wife was pregnant.  However, overexposing the shot has made this much more interesting for me and unique from similar photos.  Nice!</td>', 'A proven good composure that I wish I had done when my wife was pregnant.  However, overexposing the shot has made this much more interesting for me and unique from similar photos.  Nice!', '2010-12-01 05:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239786, 923123, 40391, '<td valign="top">A lovely dramatic and imposing image!  I really like the lack of life in this shot.  Its almost as if the place is abandoned.</td>', 'A lovely dramatic and imposing image!  I really like the lack of life in this shot.  Its almost as if the place is abandoned.', '2010-12-01 05:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239788, 922717, 40391, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a great capture and composition!  Its a bit of a pity some of the birds are blown but it doesnt take away too much from the impact of this shot.  Well done!</td>', 'Wow, what a great capture and composition!  Its a bit of a pity some of the birds are blown but it doesnt take away too much from the impact of this shot.  Well done!', '2010-12-01 05:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239790, 923096, 40391, '<td valign="top">Its a nice shot but I find the bird to be a bit lost in the background and the blown highlight of the branch distracting.</td>', 'Its a nice shot but I find the bird to be a bit lost in the background and the blown highlight of the branch distracting.', '2010-12-01 05:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239791, 922620, 40391, '<td valign="top">Nice details on the bricks and I like the grey reflection in the windows.  However, overall Im not finding this shot all that interesting for a free challenge.</td>', 'Nice details on the bricks and I like the grey reflection in the windows.  However, overall Im not finding this shot all that interesting for a free challenge.', '2010-12-01 05:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239792, 923165, 40391, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasting effect with the bare branches but I feel the distracting lower bright light and the sensor dust in the sky takes away from your image.</td>', 'Nice contrasting effect with the bare branches but I feel the distracting lower bright light and the sensor dust in the sky takes away from your image.', '2010-12-01 05:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239796, 923194, 40391, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot with lovely colours and excellent use of DoF.  At first I thought it was a pity his eyes were shot but after looking for longer I feel it adds to the photograph.  Well done!</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot with lovely colours and excellent use of DoF.  At first I thought it was a pity his eyes were shot but after looking for longer I feel it adds to the photograph.  Well done!', '2010-12-01 05:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239797, 922200, 40391, '<td valign="top">Lovely vibrant colours and good composition.  I like the simple but appropriate title too.</td>', 'Lovely vibrant colours and good composition.  I like the simple but appropriate title too.', '2010-12-01 05:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239798, 923076, 40391, '<td valign="top">Very well composed and executed shot.  Its the post processing that really makes this shot work so well for me.  Its interesting, dramatic and yet somehow subtle.</td>', 'Very well composed and executed shot.  Its the post processing that really makes this shot work so well for me.  Its interesting, dramatic and yet somehow subtle.', '2010-12-01 05:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239802, 921793, 40391, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed but even better post processing.  Well done!</td>', 'Nicely composed but even better post processing.  Well done!', '2010-12-01 05:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239803, 923038, 40391, '<td valign="top">Rule of eights :-)   Great lighting but its the excessive white background that really makes this an interesting shot.</td>', 'Rule of eights :-)   Great lighting but its the excessive white background that really makes this an interesting shot.', '2010-12-01 05:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239804, 923201, 40391, '<td valign="top">Very cute!  I love the way youve made the eyes pop but it may have been slightly overdone for me.</td>', 'Very cute!  I love the way youve made the eyes pop but it may have been slightly overdone for me.', '2010-12-01 05:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239805, 923116, 40391, '<td valign="top">For some reason Im sure Ive seen a very similar shot of this location recently.  Anyway, this is a great shot and I love the way branches are reaching out to the building.  The lighting and contrast is excellent.</td>', 'For some reason Im sure Ive seen a very similar shot of this location recently.  Anyway, this is a great shot and I love the way branches are reaching out to the building.  The lighting and contrast is excellent.', '2010-12-01 05:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239807, 923008, 40391, '<td valign="top">I really like this photograph.  The contrast, lighting and composition are effective.  Im not usually a fan of excessive boarders but it really works well with you image.  Well done!</td>', 'I really like this photograph.  The contrast, lighting and composition are effective.  Im not usually a fan of excessive boarders but it really works well with you image.  Well done!', '2010-12-01 05:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239808, 922699, 108580, '<td valign="top">Kogel Bay? This is stunning, not as soft as always and the overcast sky has made it a bit duller where you might not have used more than ND2? <br/>Can only be one or maybe two photogs who shoot this site and like this.<br/>My guess it''s Philip but it could also be Konrad.<br/>I drove past there last Wednesday but with such a huge entourage I couldn''t stop to take go to the shore and take a few shots. I did get some hand held from the road however :)<br/>Hope this does well for you!</td>', 'Kogel Bay? This is stunning, not as soft as always and the overcast sky has made it a bit duller where you might not have used more than ND2? Can only be one or maybe two photogs who shoot this site and like this.My guess it''s Philip but it could also be Konrad.I drove past there last Wednesday but with such a huge entourage I couldn''t stop to take go to the shore and take a few shots. I did get some hand held from the road however :)Hope this does well for you!', '2010-12-01 05:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239811, 922474, 40391, '<td valign="top">This is not a shot or nice image  Its pure art and should be shown in a gallery.  Added to my favourites.</td>', 'This is not a shot or nice image  Its pure art and should be shown in a gallery.  Added to my favourites.', '2010-12-01 05:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239812, 920632, 40391, '<td valign="top">Perhaps slightly heavy on the PP but for me it works and this shot is telling a story I would like to know more of.  Well done!</td>', 'Perhaps slightly heavy on the PP but for me it works and this shot is telling a story I would like to know more of.  Well done!', '2010-12-01 05:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239816, 918946, 40391, '<td valign="top">This is quite well captured but is not all that interesting for me.  I do like your title though.</td>', 'This is quite well captured but is not all that interesting for me.  I do like your title though.', '2010-12-01 05:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239817, 922413, 40391, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and effect.  I especially like the effects of the clouds.</td>', 'Lovely colours and effect.  I especially like the effects of the clouds.', '2010-12-01 05:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239819, 923187, 40391, '<td valign="top">Very well shot and great choice of background.</td>', 'Very well shot and great choice of background.', '2010-12-01 05:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239821, 923175, 40391, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of action.  For me it would have been even more interesting if the exposure was slight longer giving an abstract blur to the image.</td>', 'Nice capture of action.  For me it would have been even more interesting if the exposure was slight longer giving an abstract blur to the image.', '2010-12-01 05:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239824, 922255, 40391, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but the over exposure is maybe a tad too much for me.  The textures a great thought.  Well done!  I hope you explain the title.</td>', 'Nice composition but the over exposure is maybe a tad too much for me.  The textures a great thought.  Well done!  I hope you explain the title.', '2010-12-01 05:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239829, 922942, 40391, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot!  Now this is my home town so what was the occasion that I missed?</td>', 'Excellent shot!  Now this is my home town so what was the occasion that I missed?', '2010-12-01 05:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239831, 922351, 40391, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and use of DoF.</td>', 'Nice capture and use of DoF.', '2010-12-01 06:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239835, 922725, 40391, '<td valign="top">Although the sun feels too blown the overall effect is fabulous!  The silhouetted clouds are lovely.</td>', 'Although the sun feels too blown the overall effect is fabulous!  The silhouetted clouds are lovely.', '2010-12-01 06:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239838, 923114, 40391, '<td valign="top">This is such a fantastic shot with great feeling and lovely colours.  The boarder for me isnt working (perhaps the extra white or something) but the image is too enthralling to let that affect my vote.  Well done!</td>', 'This is such a fantastic shot with great feeling and lovely colours.  The boarder for me isnt working (perhaps the extra white or something) but the image is too enthralling to let that affect my vote.  Well done!', '2010-12-01 06:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239840, 920244, 40391, '<td valign="top">Nice location, colours and composition but it is just not quite enough to do well in a Free Study IMO.</td>', 'Nice location, colours and composition but it is just not quite enough to do well in a Free Study IMO.', '2010-12-01 06:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6239841, 921740, 40391, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture!  However, its the bokeh that really makes this shot for me  oh and the title :-)</td>', 'Excellent capture!  However, its the bokeh that really makes this shot for me  oh and the title :-)', '2010-12-01 06:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
