(6240936, 922818, 115307, '<td valign="top">Really great idea! I think with some experimentation you could really get a fantastic shot out of this! In my opinion, its not quite there yet. I think the picture is a little too wide, there is too much uninteresting material here like the sky, blurry  shore line etc, that draw the eye away from what is fantastic about this photo, which is the play of light across the water drops on the board. The highlights of the drops and shadows on the board is lovely.<br/>I would like to see a slightly lower perspective to put more emphasis on the drops more. A cloudy sky might also add some nice colors and add some interest to the rest of the picture that isn''t composed of board.<br/>Keep chugging along, I really think you are getting somewhere with this shot. 6</td>', 'Really great idea! I think with some experimentation you could really get a fantastic shot out of this! In my opinion, its not quite there yet. I think the picture is a little too wide, there is too much uninteresting material here like the sky, blurry  shore line etc, that draw the eye away from what is fantastic about this photo, which is the play of light across the water drops on the board. The highlights of the drops and shadows on the board is lovely.I would like to see a slightly lower perspective to put more emphasis on the drops more. A cloudy sky might also add some nice colors and add some interest to the rest of the picture that isn''t composed of board.Keep chugging along, I really think you are getting somewhere with this shot. 6', '2010-12-01 19:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240947, 923086, 115307, '<td valign="top">Wow, her blue eyes are absolutely striking! Great fashion shot 8</td>', 'Wow, her blue eyes are absolutely striking! Great fashion shot 8', '2010-12-01 19:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
