(6241151, 921762, 96751, '<td valign="top">I''m conflicted by this image.  The separate elements are incredible.  The dew on the web is gorgeous, and dof is perfect, the b/w a great choice.  But I feel that all the elements are fighting each other.  I don''t know where to look.  I''m drawn to the leaf on the far end of the bench but am interrupted in my reverie by the web.  I want to explore the web but the leaves on the ground call to me.  I would love an even shallower dof on either the web (to highlight the bench) or on the bench (to render the web a gauzy filter).</td>', 'I''m conflicted by this image.  The separate elements are incredible.  The dew on the web is gorgeous, and dof is perfect, the b/w a great choice.  But I feel that all the elements are fighting each other.  I don''t know where to look.  I''m drawn to the leaf on the far end of the bench but am interrupted in my reverie by the web.  I want to explore the web but the leaves on the ground call to me.  I would love an even shallower dof on either the web (to highlight the bench) or on the bench (to render the web a gauzy filter).', '2010-12-01 21:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
