(6241204, 922542, 96751, '<td valign="top">LOL!  This image brings to mind the recent mishap of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=87808" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">JulietNN</a> with her camera.  The energy here is so palpable, as is the mist from the water.  Gorgeous tones too.</td>', 'LOL!  This image brings to mind the recent mishap of  JulietNN with her camera.  The energy here is so palpable, as is the mist from the water.  Gorgeous tones too.', '2010-12-01 21:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
