(6241449, 922826, 123882, '<td valign="top">outstanding the eyes are so alive</td>', 'outstanding the eyes are so alive', '2010-12-02 00:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241451, 922626, 40391, '<td valign="top">I love the softness of the shapes and colours.  What a lovely location.  Its probably my pathetic laptop but there are strange things happening in the sky  some sort of banding silhouettes.  Im sure its probably caused from my end so it wont effect my vote.  Well done!</td>', 'I love the softness of the shapes and colours.  What a lovely location.  Its probably my pathetic laptop but there are strange things happening in the sky  some sort of banding silhouettes.  Im sure its probably caused from my end so it wont effect my vote.  Well done!', '2010-12-02 01:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241458, 923198, 40391, '<td valign="top">Im assuming the seal is created by motorbike burn-outs and not a runaway PS burn tool ;-)  The image intrigues me wanting me to look at it for longer than most.  I like it.</td>', 'Im assuming the seal is created by motorbike burn-outs and not a runaway PS burn tool ;-)  The image intrigues me wanting me to look at it for longer than most.  I like it.', '2010-12-02 01:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241462, 923041, 40391, '<td valign="top">I like the halo around the moon and the overall composition of the image.  This is a great find.  Unfortunately, the blown face of the church distracts from the rest of this lovely image.</td>', 'I like the halo around the moon and the overall composition of the image.  This is a great find.  Unfortunately, the blown face of the church distracts from the rest of this lovely image.', '2010-12-02 01:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241471, 923011, 40391, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful image so very well capture.  The feeling it portrays is marvellous.  For me it may even have worked better if made slightly darker to reduce the impact from the sun in the upper right and make the stag fully silhouetted.</td>', 'What a beautiful image so very well capture.  The feeling it portrays is marvellous.  For me it may even have worked better if made slightly darker to reduce the impact from the sun in the upper right and make the stag fully silhouetted.', '2010-12-02 01:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241473, 922491, 40391, '<td valign="top">Simple yet very interesting.</td>', 'Simple yet very interesting.', '2010-12-02 01:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241478, 922943, 40391, '<td valign="top">Very nicely captured!</td>', 'Very nicely captured!', '2010-12-02 01:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241488, 922354, 40391, '<td valign="top">Fireworks over Sydney and now Perth.  Ive been away a bit this month.  Did I miss some celebration in November?  Im pretty hopeless at night photography and havent tried to capture fireworks yet so Im probably not the best to criticise but the building lights just dont seem as clear as others Ive seen.  However, the colours are fantastic, especially those reflected in the water.  Overall, a pleasing image.</td>', 'Fireworks over Sydney and now Perth.  Ive been away a bit this month.  Did I miss some celebration in November?  Im pretty hopeless at night photography and havent tried to capture fireworks yet so Im probably not the best to criticise but the building lights just dont seem as clear as others Ive seen.  However, the colours are fantastic, especially those reflected in the water.  Overall, a pleasing image.', '2010-12-02 01:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241494, 922733, 40391, '<td valign="top">You''re right, no signs of life anywhere.  Is this a volcano?  The contrasting colours of the blue sky and red earth (Mars?) are lovely, as are the clouds.</td>', 'You''re right, no signs of life anywhere.  Is this a volcano?  The contrasting colours of the blue sky and red earth (Mars?) are lovely, as are the clouds.', '2010-12-02 01:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241496, 921741, 40391, '<td valign="top">This is so smooth and dreamy.  I have no idea what it is but that is obviously not important.  The dull colours and soft white work beautifully together.  Very pleasing to view.  Well done!</td>', 'This is so smooth and dreamy.  I have no idea what it is but that is obviously not important.  The dull colours and soft white work beautifully together.  Very pleasing to view.  Well done!', '2010-12-02 01:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241500, 923145, 40391, '<td valign="top">What a stunning landscape with wonderful earthy colours.  However, theres something about the unnatural harshness of this shot that isnt quite working for me.  It may have been slightly over sharpened or it truly is like this in real life and Im not recognising it for never being there.  It does look like a very interesting place.</td>', 'What a stunning landscape with wonderful earthy colours.  However, theres something about the unnatural harshness of this shot that isnt quite working for me.  It may have been slightly over sharpened or it truly is like this in real life and Im not recognising it for never being there.  It does look like a very interesting place.', '2010-12-02 01:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241503, 922344, 40391, '<td valign="top">Talk about striking a great pose in the perfect location thats then excellently captured by you!  Well done!</td>', 'Talk about striking a great pose in the perfect location thats then excellently captured by you!  Well done!', '2010-12-02 01:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241504, 922742, 40391, '<td valign="top">What a lovely high-key image.  I would have stood in that same place and taken a completely different shot have been anywhere near as interesting and beautiful as this.  Well done!</td>', 'What a lovely high-key image.  I would have stood in that same place and taken a completely different shot have been anywhere near as interesting and beautiful as this.  Well done!', '2010-12-02 01:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241506, 923152, 40391, '<td valign="top">A beautiful and moody image that could be used commercially for a book or album cover or nicely framed hanging on a wall.  Well done!</td>', 'A beautiful and moody image that could be used commercially for a book or album cover or nicely framed hanging on a wall.  Well done!', '2010-12-02 01:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241509, 922628, 40391, '<td valign="top">What a lovely emotion you have captured here.  Her eyes are amazing and the B&amp;W process youve used is great.</td>', 'What a lovely emotion you have captured here.  Her eyes are amazing and the B&W process youve used is great.', '2010-12-02 01:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
