(6241515, 921721, 40391, '<td valign="top">Cute shot of the model but is not really doing that much for me in a FS.  However, whats happening in the background looks kind of interesting which I would love to see more of.</td>', 'Cute shot of the model but is not really doing that much for me in a FS.  However, whats happening in the background looks kind of interesting which I would love to see more of.', '2010-12-02 01:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
