(6241556, 922233, 40391, '<td valign="top">First you find a really beautiful location with and interesting subject added, then you somehow appease the Weather Gods to help you create this stunning image!  Im this happens for you all the time ;-)  Very well done!</td>', 'First you find a really beautiful location with and interesting subject added, then you somehow appease the Weather Gods to help you create this stunning image!  Im this happens for you all the time ;-)  Very well done!', '2010-12-02 02:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
