(6241559, 923061, 40391, '<td valign="top">At first I wasnt sure that I liked your post processing of this.  But the more I look and study it the more it becomes an interesting photo.  Yes, I dont mind this at all.</td>', 'At first I wasnt sure that I liked your post processing of this.  But the more I look and study it the more it becomes an interesting photo.  Yes, I dont mind this at all.', '2010-12-02 02:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
