(6241734, 922059, 40391, '<td valign="top">A pleasant and calming shot but its not quite doing enough for me.  The people seem too lost with the foreground and it doesnt really pop out.  Its still well composed and peaceful. Enter your comment here, and then cast your vote...</td>', 'A pleasant and calming shot but its not quite doing enough for me.  The people seem too lost with the foreground and it doesnt really pop out.  Its still well composed and peaceful. Enter your comment here, and then cast your vote...', '2010-12-02 08:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241736, 917918, 40391, '<td valign="top">The leaves are beautiful but the sun is just too distracting to me from this nice image.</td>', 'The leaves are beautiful but the sun is just too distracting to me from this nice image.', '2010-12-02 08:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
