(6241740, 921707, 40391, '<td valign="top">Its not often I see a shot that actually captures snow.  The curve of the street and complimentary foot prints leads me though this image beautifully.</td>', 'Its not often I see a shot that actually captures snow.  The curve of the street and complimentary foot prints leads me though this image beautifully.', '2010-12-02 08:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
