(6241748, 923032, 40391, '<td valign="top">She is just so gorgeous!  The desaturation and the way she pops so well in the image really makes this shot.  Well done!</td>', 'She is just so gorgeous!  The desaturation and the way she pops so well in the image really makes this shot.  Well done!', '2010-12-02 08:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
