(6241775, 923206, 60495, '<td valign="top">Great action shot, well captured and the focus and stop action was handled very well. Its unfortunate the sign in the background had to be were it is but not much you can do about that, I would have been tempted to clone the sign out but for a challenge that may have been border line on pushing the rules. Nice shot, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Great action shot, well captured and the focus and stop action was handled very well. Its unfortunate the sign in the background had to be were it is but not much you can do about that, I would have been tempted to clone the sign out but for a challenge that may have been border line on pushing the rules. Nice shot, good luck in the challenge.', '2010-12-02 08:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241776, 923170, 40391, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic effect you have achieved with this image.</td>', 'What a fantastic effect you have achieved with this image.', '2010-12-02 08:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
