(6241826, 922733, 3102, '<td valign="top">Looks like Haleakala to me!  What an amazing place.  Never thought I''d freeze my butt off in Hawaii, but we certainly did there!</td>', 'Looks like Haleakala to me!  What an amazing place.  Never thought I''d freeze my butt off in Hawaii, but we certainly did there!', '2010-12-02 09:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
