(6242269, 921762, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great find. What I appreciate the most in this photo is it''s not just the web or, more specifically, it''s not just the dew on the web that''s supposed to be the star of the image. It''s just a filter, an interesting semitransparent foreground element through which to take in the rest of the moody autumn scene. Excellent photo.</td>', 'Great find. What I appreciate the most in this photo is it''s not just the web or, more specifically, it''s not just the dew on the web that''s supposed to be the star of the image. It''s just a filter, an interesting semitransparent foreground element through which to take in the rest of the moody autumn scene. Excellent photo.', '2010-12-02 17:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
