(6244782, 922474, 83313, '<td valign="top">Wow. Looking forward to finding out whose this is and how you did this look. I sure hope this ribbons instead of the usual landscape.</td>', 'Wow. Looking forward to finding out whose this is and how you did this look. I sure hope this ribbons instead of the usual landscape.', '2010-12-04 23:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244785, 922972, 83313, '<td valign="top">Oh, cool. Looks like a microscopic xmas tree.</td>', 'Oh, cool. Looks like a microscopic xmas tree.', '2010-12-05 00:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244787, 922626, 83313, '<td valign="top">I really love the look you''ve given to this scene, except for one major thing, and that''s the heavy banding in the sky. When I run into that, the solution is usually to selectively adjust the foreground and sky on separate layers.</td>', 'I really love the look you''ve given to this scene, except for one major thing, and that''s the heavy banding in the sky. When I run into that, the solution is usually to selectively adjust the foreground and sky on separate layers.', '2010-12-05 00:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244788, 919196, 30364, '<td valign="top">Wistful, beautiful.  It''s remarkably satisfying, such a sense of quiet resolution.  Thank you.</td>', 'Wistful, beautiful.  It''s remarkably satisfying, such a sense of quiet resolution.  Thank you.', '2010-12-05 00:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244791, 918706, 30364, '<td valign="top">A scream, a bullet hole, a sharp prickle.  Fortunately, it''s untitled.  So I''ll never have to decide.  But I do like it.  Thank you.</td>', 'A scream, a bullet hole, a sharp prickle.  Fortunately, it''s untitled.  So I''ll never have to decide.  But I do like it.  Thank you.', '2010-12-05 00:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244792, 922738, 30364, '<td valign="top">Clever.  Love that title.  Thank you.</td>', 'Clever.  Love that title.  Thank you.', '2010-12-05 00:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244796, 920320, 30364, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  The lone tree trunk in the centre seems the only certainty among all the movement and conjecture.  8.  Thank you.</td>', 'Lovely.  The lone tree trunk in the centre seems the only certainty among all the movement and conjecture.  8.  Thank you.', '2010-12-05 00:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244801, 923144, 30364, '<td valign="top">Stopped me in my tracks.  As well as its obvious interest of the face versus the hand, there is a wonderful puzzle in all the shadows.  Ultimately it does have a contrived feel, something merely theatrical rather than something authentic, but I like it anyway.  8.  Thank you.</td>', 'Stopped me in my tracks.  As well as its obvious interest of the face versus the hand, there is a wonderful puzzle in all the shadows.  Ultimately it does have a contrived feel, something merely theatrical rather than something authentic, but I like it anyway.  8.  Thank you.', '2010-12-05 00:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244807, 923198, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s not about photography at all.  Vision like this cannot be taught, nor learned, purchased, faked or explained.  Thank you.</td>', 'It''s not about photography at all.  Vision like this cannot be taught, nor learned, purchased, faked or explained.  Thank you.', '2010-12-05 00:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244809, 922336, 30364, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, eccentric photograph.  8.  Thank you.</td>', 'Wonderful, eccentric photograph.  8.  Thank you.', '2010-12-05 00:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244812, 922979, 30364, '<td valign="top">Achingly lovely.  For all the dramatic presence of the major shapes, I also enjoyed the whispered details in the foreground and at the horizon, and the economical horizontal streaks. Top three for me.. Thank you.</td>', 'Achingly lovely.  For all the dramatic presence of the major shapes, I also enjoyed the whispered details in the foreground and at the horizon, and the economical horizontal streaks. Top three for me.. Thank you.', '2010-12-05 00:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244814, 922491, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Near to perfect in both conception and execution.  Top two for me.  Thank you.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Near to perfect in both conception and execution.  Top two for me.  Thank you.', '2010-12-05 00:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244820, 922450, 83313, '<td valign="top">Youngling will be great hunter and warrior one day (not great like Grog, but still great). Grog sees youngling has already hunted and bested fierce animal. Tribe will eat well tonight and stories of greatness will be told.</td>', 'Youngling will be great hunter and warrior one day (not great like Grog, but still great). Grog sees youngling has already hunted and bested fierce animal. Tribe will eat well tonight and stories of greatness will be told.', '2010-12-05 00:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244821, 920570, 83313, '<td valign="top">I had to move back a little to take it in properly, but I can see the pachyderm. Well seen. I''m curious how this will do on the heels of the Posthumous challenge. This being DPC, I''m afraid things will be back to normal and this will get creamed.</td>', 'I had to move back a little to take it in properly, but I can see the pachyderm. Well seen. I''m curious how this will do on the heels of the Posthumous challenge. This being DPC, I''m afraid things will be back to normal and this will get creamed.', '2010-12-05 00:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244856, 919993, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: A most lovely portrait benefitting from highly effective lighting. The crisp focus on the hands and the paintingish softness of the rest of the image conspires with the coloration and lighting to produce something quite special.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: I have mixed feelings about the surface at the bottom of the image and the wall moulding on the right - they seem to intrude and detract a little but if I mask them out with my hands the image seems diminished. On balance I think their presence gives context and life to the image.<br/> <br/>Overall: An image that gets better and better the more you look at it. So much so that by the time I''ve got to the end of my looking and writing I feel a need to fav it.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: A most lovely portrait benefitting from highly effective lighting. The crisp focus on the hands and the paintingish softness of the rest of the image conspires with the coloration and lighting to produce something quite special. Critical stuff: I have mixed feelings about the surface at the bottom of the image and the wall moulding on the right - they seem to intrude and detract a little but if I mask them out with my hands the image seems diminished. On balance I think their presence gives context and life to the image. Overall: An image that gets better and better the more you look at it. So much so that by the time I''ve got to the end of my looking and writing I feel a need to fav it.', '2010-12-05 03:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244863, 918888, 106910, '<td valign="top">Imaginative, emotive, and simply stunning. 10</td>', 'Imaginative, emotive, and simply stunning. 10', '2010-12-05 03:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
