(6244877, 921150, 90896, '<td valign="top">Very moody.  I like the feeling a lot.  Lose the top of the frame, I want my eyes to go to the golden framed lighthouse first. Excellent exposure.</td>', 'Very moody.  I like the feeling a lot.  Lose the top of the frame, I want my eyes to go to the golden framed lighthouse first. Excellent exposure.', '2010-12-05 05:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
