(6245212, 921741, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: A very nice blurry abstract - but what blur! I really like the helical pattern you have produced and the colours are perfect for this - the deep red and blue combination works really well. The whole thing makes me wonder what the underpinning subject is.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing really.<br/> <br/>Overall: A really super abstract.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: A very nice blurry abstract - but what blur! I really like the helical pattern you have produced and the colours are perfect for this - the deep red and blue combination works really well. The whole thing makes me wonder what the underpinning subject is. Critical stuff: Nothing really. Overall: A really super abstract.', '2010-12-05 14:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6245213, 923131, 76335, '<td valign="top">It feels overexposed, though I think you were going for high key. I can''t really tell what''s in her left hand (another flower?); green thing in the lower left is unappealing, distracting. I do like the look and feel you were trying to achieve, and I think you got most of the way there.</td>', 'It feels overexposed, though I think you were going for high key. I can''t really tell what''s in her left hand (another flower?); green thing in the lower left is unappealing, distracting. I do like the look and feel you were trying to achieve, and I think you got most of the way there.', '2010-12-05 14:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
