(6245447, 923156, 76335, '<td valign="top">First things first... Hello, Yo_Spiff. <br/> <br/>Nice treatment, and I''m saying that knowing the T word is part of the processing. The result, bordering on high key, is actually very pleasing to they eye. <br/> <br/>I love the couple. The general (?) seems to be taking in a moment of reflection, while his wife (?) is smiling obediently at the camera. It''s a great human moment. (Do you know them? They should get a print.) <br/> <br/>Sigh. Then there''s the border. I can deal with it, I suppose. Actually, I''m surprised it''s legal with the staining/browning effect. <br/> <br/>Overall, very nice. I give you a three. (Unless this is cowtownmom, in which case I give you a seven.)</td>', 'First things first... Hello, Yo_Spiff.  Nice treatment, and I''m saying that knowing the T word is part of the processing. The result, bordering on high key, is actually very pleasing to they eye.  I love the couple. The general (?) seems to be taking in a moment of reflection, while his wife (?) is smiling obediently at the camera. It''s a great human moment. (Do you know them? They should get a print.)  Sigh. Then there''s the border. I can deal with it, I suppose. Actually, I''m surprised it''s legal with the staining/browning effect.  Overall, very nice. I give you a three. (Unless this is cowtownmom, in which case I give you a seven.)', '2010-12-05 21:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
