(6246817, 922345, 18367, '<td valign="top">Mes compliments, c''est une très belle photo.  Just in case you don''t understand French, that is definitely a beautiful image that the parents of this child will cherish in years to come.<br/> <br/>Small critique, you may wish to clone out the hoof.  The very best of luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Mes compliments, c''est une très belle photo.  Just in case you don''t understand French, that is definitely a beautiful image that the parents of this child will cherish in years to come. Small critique, you may wish to clone out the hoof.  The very best of luck in the challenge.', '2010-12-06 22:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6246906, 918485, 120129, '<td valign="top">Wow...It''s not icky at all! In fact I find I think that is the cutest bug face I''ve ever seen! The slanted surface is genius. I''ve come back to look at this several times...well done.</td>', 'Wow...It''s not icky at all! In fact I find I think that is the cutest bug face I''ve ever seen! The slanted surface is genius. I''ve come back to look at this several times...well done.', '2010-12-07 00:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6246909, 921340, 120129, '<td valign="top">Ingenious pairing, really refreshing use of naturally pale colors, and honoring the under-rated snail by featuring him make this work worthy of a ribbon. Good luck.</td>', 'Ingenious pairing, really refreshing use of naturally pale colors, and honoring the under-rated snail by featuring him make this work worthy of a ribbon. Good luck.', '2010-12-07 00:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6246912, 922818, 120129, '<td valign="top">You nailed this on Bro. I''m right there, on the water, in the moment. Nicely done.</td>', 'You nailed this on Bro. I''m right there, on the water, in the moment. Nicely done.', '2010-12-07 00:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6246915, 918888, 120129, '<td valign="top">Wow.. you''ve got more creativity and motivation than the average bear.You get a 10 just for the idea. The results; another 10. Alas I can only give 10.</td>', 'Wow.. you''ve got more creativity and motivation than the average bear.You get a 10 just for the idea. The results; another 10. Alas I can only give 10.', '2010-12-07 00:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6246923, 922673, 120129, '<td valign="top">There is so much competition in this challenge! Stunning. Leaves me breathless. Sometimes long shutter water images are blurred so smooth and pillowy, looseing much of the motion detail and threatening to put me to sleep... Not this one. You captured the vibrant motion of this water while not destroying the real power of it. And don''t get me started on the colors! Makes me want to jump in and ride down into the light. Very nice indeed.</td>', 'There is so much competition in this challenge! Stunning. Leaves me breathless. Sometimes long shutter water images are blurred so smooth and pillowy, looseing much of the motion detail and threatening to put me to sleep... Not this one. You captured the vibrant motion of this water while not destroying the real power of it. And don''t get me started on the colors! Makes me want to jump in and ride down into the light. Very nice indeed.', '2010-12-07 00:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6246930, 922298, 120129, '<td valign="top">This is spectacular. Lighting is everything, it feels like I''m invited in to see a place of beauty. I don''t know if I would have cropped the top so tight, but that doesn''t mean you didn''t do the right thing... it''s a show stopper.</td>', 'This is spectacular. Lighting is everything, it feels like I''m invited in to see a place of beauty. I don''t know if I would have cropped the top so tight, but that doesn''t mean you didn''t do the right thing... it''s a show stopper.', '2010-12-07 00:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6246932, 922341, 120129, '<td valign="top">Firstly, you should win this challenge simply for the difficulty of this shot. 10 I''ve done my part.</td>', 'Firstly, you should win this challenge simply for the difficulty of this shot. 10 I''ve done my part.', '2010-12-07 00:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
