(6246935, 923086, 120129, '<td valign="top">Well named. Your treatment of this model, from the technically perfect dof to the spectacular use of light is nothing short of genius. There are so many great photos in this challenge, that I worry that her blue eyes are ever slightly too blue. But I so love the work, and only hope to do something this good someday.</td>', 'Well named. Your treatment of this model, from the technically perfect dof to the spectacular use of light is nothing short of genius. There are so many great photos in this challenge, that I worry that her blue eyes are ever slightly too blue. But I so love the work, and only hope to do something this good someday.', '2010-12-07 00:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
