(6247131, 918450, 63218, '<td valign="top">This was easy to dismiss because of the lack of sharp clear focus, at least on my monitor. But the light is clear &amp; soft, &amp; as I was gazing at it I fell in love with it.  The little bit of green leaf makes a path for my eye to the collar of green under the dandelion, the slight reflection of green, the almost in focus seeds, the strange mauve BG. The luminous white.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=832149" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_832149.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_832149.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_832149.jpg"/></a> <br/>I haven''t awarded a Gilded Lily in a while.  Please accept this offer of my admiration for your work here.</td>', 'This was easy to dismiss because of the lack of sharp clear focus, at least on my monitor. But the light is clear & soft, & as I was gazing at it I fell in love with it.  The little bit of green leaf makes a path for my eye to the collar of green under the dandelion, the slight reflection of green, the almost in focus seeds, the strange mauve BG. The luminous white. I haven''t awarded a Gilded Lily in a while.  Please accept this offer of my admiration for your work here.', '2010-12-07 09:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6247175, 921988, 117474, '<td valign="top">Amusing capture. Humorous subject. Nice composure. I''ve no doubt who did this (I think it''s mostly cause the eyes remind me of this image //www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=895565 )<br/> <br/>The only little nit pick I have about it is that it seems a little over saturated... It''s fitting to have a red face for this (I''m assuming you''re going for the drunken farming fighting, um, ''theme''?) but his hat seems over-vibrant to me. (I think you might get a few comments about this?)<br/>I wonder if his eyes are a little too clear actually. For a normal portrait they''re perfect. But, if I''m right with my assertion of him meant to be brawling after a few too many, shouldn''t his eyes be maybe a little blood shot? Or perhaps he''s just defending his farm? <br/>Hmm. <br/>I like it. I''d vote it around 6 I think.</td>', 'Amusing capture. Humorous subject. Nice composure. I''ve no doubt who did this (I think it''s mostly cause the eyes remind me of this image //www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=895565 ) The only little nit pick I have about it is that it seems a little over saturated... It''s fitting to have a red face for this (I''m assuming you''re going for the drunken farming fighting, um, ''theme''?) but his hat seems over-vibrant to me. (I think you might get a few comments about this?)I wonder if his eyes are a little too clear actually. For a normal portrait they''re perfect. But, if I''m right with my assertion of him meant to be brawling after a few too many, shouldn''t his eyes be maybe a little blood shot? Or perhaps he''s just defending his farm? Hmm. I like it. I''d vote it around 6 I think.', '2010-12-07 10:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6247202, 923187, 63218, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice in the BG, at first I didn''t like it much but after a while it kinda grew on me. The FG lily is taking the interest with its darker petals/shadows--another interesting choice.  Good for you.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=832149" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_832149.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_832149.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_832149.jpg"/></a> <br/>I haven''t awarded a Gilded Lily in a while. Please accept this one from me as a token of my admiring appreciation for your work on this comp.</td>', 'Interesting choice in the BG, at first I didn''t like it much but after a while it kinda grew on me. The FG lily is taking the interest with its darker petals/shadows--another interesting choice.  Good for you. I haven''t awarded a Gilded Lily in a while. Please accept this one from me as a token of my admiring appreciation for your work on this comp.', '2010-12-07 11:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
