(6247301, 922223, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid I only gave this a 5. It''s a good effort at street photography with a message, but it didn''t have any impact on me somehow. Maybe it''s the light, maybe it''s the sepia tone. I think one major issue is that the perspective and overall composition does not draw me in to this person''s plight.</td>', 'I''m afraid I only gave this a 5. It''s a good effort at street photography with a message, but it didn''t have any impact on me somehow. Maybe it''s the light, maybe it''s the sepia tone. I think one major issue is that the perspective and overall composition does not draw me in to this person''s plight.', '2010-12-07 13:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6247302, 922626, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo overall. The toned down colors really add to the ambiance. It''s too bad there is such bad color banding in the sky.</td>', 'Very nice photo overall. The toned down colors really add to the ambiance. It''s too bad there is such bad color banding in the sky.', '2010-12-07 13:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
