(6247394, 920570, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: An interesting mix of textures - the oil(?), the surface and the flowers. I''m particularly fond of the colour of the flowers and how they serve to lift the image. I like how it feels ''square-on'' too.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Not much - difficult to fault something as honest as this.<br/> <br/>Overall: A nice textual piece.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: An interesting mix of textures - the oil(?), the surface and the flowers. I''m particularly fond of the colour of the flowers and how they serve to lift the image. I like how it feels ''square-on'' too. Critical stuff: Not much - difficult to fault something as honest as this. Overall: A nice textual piece.', '2010-12-07 16:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
