(6248348, 921740, 49643, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by prashant_168:</b></div><hr/><i> Nilesh, I looks like that the sun is almost overhead, how did you get such a brightness on the birds ? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Well I was lucky to get beautiful light (f/8; 1/800 sec, ISO:200)nice fill light from the light painted surface below &amp; white painted walls nearby. Along with this during processing selective levels enhanced further.</td>', 'Originally posted by prashant_168: Nilesh, I looks like that the sun is almost overhead, how did you get such a brightness on the birds ?  Well I was lucky to get beautiful light (f/8; 1/800 sec, ISO:200)nice fill light from the light painted surface below & white painted walls nearby. Along with this during processing selective levels enhanced further.', '2010-12-08 01:58:51.000000', NULL, 0),
