(6248400, 921426, 40391, '<td valign="top">I thought I had commented on every shot this challenge but yours must have been DQd before I got to it.  A miss understanding or oversight of the rules doesnt mean this doesnt deserve comments.<br/> <br/>This is a great macro shot that shows the difficulty required to capture as there is no way this bee was in the fridge for the last half hour to slow it down.   Yes, it would have been nice to have the flower in focus too but the absolute perfect shot does not come that often in a life time and the fact you have the bee so well focused would have earned extra point s from me.  This would have gotten a 7 from me.  Well done!</td>', 'I thought I had commented on every shot this challenge but yours must have been DQd before I got to it.  A miss understanding or oversight of the rules doesnt mean this doesnt deserve comments. This is a great macro shot that shows the difficulty required to capture as there is no way this bee was in the fridge for the last half hour to slow it down.   Yes, it would have been nice to have the flower in focus too but the absolute perfect shot does not come that often in a life time and the fact you have the bee so well focused would have earned extra point s from me.  This would have gotten a 7 from me.  Well done!', '2010-12-08 03:05:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(6248411, 922341, 86218, '<td valign="top">Just beautiful. From another planet and you are good at making us all jealous with your perfect day in Iceland</td>', 'Just beautiful. From another planet and you are good at making us all jealous with your perfect day in Iceland', '2010-12-08 03:23:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(6248423, 922341, 68514, '<td valign="top">Congrats, e nice landscape.</td>', 'Congrats, e nice landscape.', '2010-12-08 03:34:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6248426, 923189, 68514, '<td valign="top">This was one of my best for the challenge. Congrats.</td>', 'This was one of my best for the challenge. Congrats.', '2010-12-08 03:35:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6248427, 922336, 119666, '<td valign="top">First of all, thanks to the DPC community for making me feel welcome already and being so generous with your votes! I was just hoping to stay above a 5 this time around.<br/> <br/>For those who asked, ''What made the tracks?'' - yeah, we''re still wondering here too. A bird dragging it''s tail? A lizard moving on it''s hind legs? (we do get those here) - it was gone by the time we arrived.<br/> <br/>For Abra, yeah, it is missing something, I was playing it safe for my first post so I picked a shot I like but I don''t know why I like it. I cop a bit of flak from friends for loving a good tilt shot, so I''m glad it added something here - rather than detracting too much!<br/> <br/>Again, thanks to all.</td>', 'First of all, thanks to the DPC community for making me feel welcome already and being so generous with your votes! I was just hoping to stay above a 5 this time around. For those who asked, ''What made the tracks?'' - yeah, we''re still wondering here too. A bird dragging it''s tail? A lizard moving on it''s hind legs? (we do get those here) - it was gone by the time we arrived. For Abra, yeah, it is missing something, I was playing it safe for my first post so I picked a shot I like but I don''t know why I like it. I cop a bit of flak from friends for loving a good tilt shot, so I''m glad it added something here - rather than detracting too much! Again, thanks to all.', '2010-12-08 03:39:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6248446, 921861, 104809, '<td valign="top">At first glace, I thought the building window lights were snow falling, until I looked a bit longer/closer.  quite good.</td>', 'At first glace, I thought the building window lights were snow falling, until I looked a bit longer/closer.  quite good.', '2010-12-08 04:32:36.000000', NULL, 0),
