(6248633, 922292, 108069, '<td valign="top">Congrats! Awesome idea, execution and processing. Wonderfully done.</td>', 'Congrats! Awesome idea, execution and processing. Wonderfully done.', '2010-12-08 07:13:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6248640, 923142, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657241" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657241.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657241.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657241.jpg"/></a> You got an X-Prize for my highest rated shots that placed lowest on the final tally!<br/> <br/>A sorely underrated image.  The hint of a victim, the blur, the macro close up and strong linear elements of the ''teeth'' (what are they called?) all combine to create a powerfully oppressive feeling, claustrophobic and shivery.  Nicely done.</td>', ' You got an X-Prize for my highest rated shots that placed lowest on the final tally! A sorely underrated image.  The hint of a victim, the blur, the macro close up and strong linear elements of the ''teeth'' (what are they called?) all combine to create a powerfully oppressive feeling, claustrophobic and shivery.  Nicely done.', '2010-12-08 07:20:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(6248643, 923114, 7889, '<td valign="top">One of my top votes, so I am dissapointed where it finished. Still a great shot.</td>', 'One of my top votes, so I am dissapointed where it finished. Still a great shot.', '2010-12-08 07:23:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(6248645, 923003, 81530, '<td valign="top">Love the video! Congrats on a marvelous photo and perspective.</td>', 'Love the video! Congrats on a marvelous photo and perspective.', '2010-12-08 07:24:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(6248646, 922104, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657242" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657242.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657242.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657242.jpg"/></a> You got an X-Prize!  For the shots I scored highest, but came in the lowest in the final results.<br/> <br/>This is just so full of joy, sun and movement.  I think everyone else has said what I need to; it''s simply lovely.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-12-08 07:25:36.</i></td>', ' You got an X-Prize!  For the shots I scored highest, but came in the lowest in the final results. This is just so full of joy, sun and movement.  I think everyone else has said what I need to; it''s simply lovely.', '2010-12-08 07:25:15.000000', '2010-12-08 07:25:36.000000', 0),
