(6248656, 922672, 81530, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your top 10 finish. Looks like you leap frogged me in the FSM rankings with this shot. 1 more month to go, I better make it a good one ;)</td>', 'Congrats on your top 10 finish. Looks like you leap frogged me in the FSM rankings with this shot. 1 more month to go, I better make it a good one ;)', '2010-12-08 07:29:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(6248657, 922104, 30364, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> I feel as though I have just witnessed this in person, and the image has become a memory, fading away but bright with emotion.  Love it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>See?  <i>Perfect</i> appreciation of your image as so much more than just a photograph.  A comment worth a hundred DPC ribbons.  A thousand.</td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: I feel as though I have just witnessed this in person, and the image has become a memory, fading away but bright with emotion.  Love it.   See?  Perfect appreciation of your image as so much more than just a photograph.  A comment worth a hundred DPC ribbons.  A thousand.', '2010-12-08 07:29:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6248658, 922341, 81530, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. I must find a way to visit Iceland someday.</td>', 'Lovely shot. I must find a way to visit Iceland someday.', '2010-12-08 07:30:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(6248660, 918371, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657243.jpg"/></a> You got an X-Prize! For images I scored the highest, but placed the lowest.<br/> <br/>This is very evocative of real darkroom work.  The half sabatiered effect looks like so much silver on the paper.  It just feels good.  The composition and expression work well, the exposure is good, but it''s the sabatier that keeps me coming back.</td>', ' You got an X-Prize! For images I scored the highest, but placed the lowest. This is very evocative of real darkroom work.  The half sabatiered effect looks like so much silver on the paper.  It just feels good.  The composition and expression work well, the exposure is good, but it''s the sabatier that keeps me coming back.', '2010-12-08 07:31:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(6248667, 923005, 46853, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.</td>', 'I like this a lot.', '2010-12-08 07:41:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(6248670, 922341, 46853, '<td valign="top">Congrats with the second blue.  Love the moon in the shoot</td>', 'Congrats with the second blue.  Love the moon in the shoot', '2010-12-08 07:46:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(6248671, 918450, 124457, '<td valign="top">Takes a minute to appreciate(can be a good thing, surprise). Off the bat, out of focus then it forces you to look for focus and you find the leaf below. You notice the stem and draw up to the lower blue tip green in the dandy. Then a look at the dandies brown center. Pretty cool! Surrounded by the white shell it takes on an otherworldly appeal. Nice softness to the interior white then a sharpness on the exterior white like an atmosphere or a protective shell. That said, too much of nothing above the dandy. Dull grass blade blur I would have traded for more dandy, two thirds not half. Maybe if the blade was not so blurred and a little greener or more blades...but what do I know. Makes me want to buy a macro!</td>', 'Takes a minute to appreciate(can be a good thing, surprise). Off the bat, out of focus then it forces you to look for focus and you find the leaf below. You notice the stem and draw up to the lower blue tip green in the dandy. Then a look at the dandies brown center. Pretty cool! Surrounded by the white shell it takes on an otherworldly appeal. Nice softness to the interior white then a sharpness on the exterior white like an atmosphere or a protective shell. That said, too much of nothing above the dandy. Dull grass blade blur I would have traded for more dandy, two thirds not half. Maybe if the blade was not so blurred and a little greener or more blades...but what do I know. Makes me want to buy a macro!', '2010-12-08 07:46:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6248674, 923049, 19944, '<td valign="top">I am embarrassed for the voters.  First that they rated this so low, and second that they rated my flower macro higher (if only ever so slightly).<br/> <br/>This is a very powerful image.  Well done, again, Enzo.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-12-08 07:53:15.</i></td>', 'I am embarrassed for the voters.  First that they rated this so low, and second that they rated my flower macro higher (if only ever so slightly). This is a very powerful image.  Well done, again, Enzo.', '2010-12-08 07:52:31.000000', '2010-12-08 07:53:15.000000', 0),
