(6249568, 918450, 121082, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments and a special thanks to pixelpig for the Gilded Lily award, my first ever. Its also the first time i had someone fav one of my photos which is exciting as well.<br/> <br/>To be honest, I took this photo when i first got my new macro lens. I didnt really have anything in mind while taking it, i just wanted to see how close i could get and this turned up. I took about 10 photos and this one to me looked the best. Looking forward to taking a lot more similar to this photo and learning as much as i can.<br/> <br/>Oh and by the way, another first, no scores of 1 :)<br/> <br/>Looking to crack a avg of 6 or higher soon.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-12-08 22:42:45.</i></td>', 'Thanks for the comments and a special thanks to pixelpig for the Gilded Lily award, my first ever. Its also the first time i had someone fav one of my photos which is exciting as well. To be honest, I took this photo when i first got my new macro lens. I didnt really have anything in mind while taking it, i just wanted to see how close i could get and this turned up. I took about 10 photos and this one to me looked the best. Looking forward to taking a lot more similar to this photo and learning as much as i can. Oh and by the way, another first, no scores of 1 :) Looking to crack a avg of 6 or higher soon.', '2010-12-08 22:41:36.000000', '2010-12-08 22:42:45.000000', 0),
