(6251537, 922733, 18197, '<td valign="top">Really nice capture. I especially like the clouds wrapping around the landscape. Wish I was there rather than enjoying our pineapple express.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-12-14 20:31:30.</i></td>', 'Really nice capture. I especially like the clouds wrapping around the landscape. Wish I was there rather than enjoying our pineapple express.', '2010-12-12 08:32:39.000000', '2010-12-14 20:31:30.000000', 0),
