(6253934, 918495, 98339, '<td valign="top">this would be a perfect entry for Architecture, Lines, or even Shapes!!! I love it...I have one suggestion if you use it in the future...run it through some noise reducing software...THAT would make such a difference in IMO...BTW  I gave you a 9 for this....Noise and all</td>', 'this would be a perfect entry for Architecture, Lines, or even Shapes!!! I love it...I have one suggestion if you use it in the future...run it through some noise reducing software...THAT would make such a difference in IMO...BTW  I gave you a 9 for this....Noise and all', '2010-12-14 19:34:36.000000', NULL, 0),
