(6293812, 923012, 113419, '<td valign="top">Lovely, simple and lovely.<br/>I favor taking photos of lone trees myself and you have done an excellent job here.</td>', 'Lovely, simple and lovely.I favor taking photos of lone trees myself and you have done an excellent job here.', '2011-01-25 15:43:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(6293814, 921288, 113419, '<td valign="top">I did not vote in this challenge but if I had I would have given you a 10.  This is a stunning image, not only is it well thought, captured and processed.  It''s very interesting.  I''d love to hear the stories this vessel could tell and the saddest of all being how it became grounded.</td>', 'I did not vote in this challenge but if I had I would have given you a 10.  This is a stunning image, not only is it well thought, captured and processed.  It''s very interesting.  I''d love to hear the stories this vessel could tell and the saddest of all being how it became grounded.', '2011-01-25 15:48:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(6293817, 922233, 113419, '<td valign="top">WOW!  What a stunning image!</td>', 'WOW!  What a stunning image!', '2011-01-25 15:51:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(6293820, 922937, 113419, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=40391" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Abra</a> called this an intriguing shot and I have to agree.  It''s one of those image that you can just enjoy but never quite can take it all in.</td>', ' Abra called this an intriguing shot and I have to agree.  It''s one of those image that you can just enjoy but never quite can take it all in.', '2011-01-25 15:56:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(6293825, 923206, 113419, '<td valign="top">WOW WHAT A CAPTURE!  Amazing clarity, super focus.  I like the image just before this one.  The horses eyes are so wide.  What a spill!  I''m sure as you said her spider girl powers saved her and I''m guessing she''s OK?  I know how she hated it.  I''ve never had anything like that happen but I remember in a barrel race, as we were taking it home my horse jumped a HUGE puddle just before the gate - the crowd thought that was incredibly funny.  I was terribly embarresd.</td>', 'WOW WHAT A CAPTURE!  Amazing clarity, super focus.  I like the image just before this one.  The horses eyes are so wide.  What a spill!  I''m sure as you said her spider girl powers saved her and I''m guessing she''s OK?  I know how she hated it.  I''ve never had anything like that happen but I remember in a barrel race, as we were taking it home my horse jumped a HUGE puddle just before the gate - the crowd thought that was incredibly funny.  I was terribly embarresd.', '2011-01-25 16:01:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(6293826, 923037, 113419, '<td valign="top">LOVE IT!</td>', 'LOVE IT!', '2011-01-25 16:02:39.000000', NULL, 0),
