(6345515, 923050, 27608, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jeger:</b></div><hr/><i> I did a double take when I saw this. he he <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=923050" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1293/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_923050.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1293/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_923050.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1293/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_923050.jpg"/></a> </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I didn''t even see this :)  Nice shot!  I finally made my way over to Reptilia while I was taking some time off.  I rented an 85mm f/1.2 II and took my 70-200mm as well.  I put the 85mm shot in the Free Study!</td>', 'Originally posted by jeger: I did a double take when I saw this. he he   I didn''t even see this :)  Nice shot!  I finally made my way over to Reptilia while I was taking some time off.  I rented an 85mm f/1.2 II and took my 70-200mm as well.  I put the 85mm shot in the Free Study!', '2011-03-08 12:17:09.000000', NULL, 0),
