(6350017, 923114, 73056, '<td valign="top">I never did see this, but I love it! Soon, I want to start experimenting with blur. I especially love people blurred with their environment - exactly what you''ve done here. I have been so focused on trying to get my technicals down for sharp, clear pictures that that''s all I''ve thought about.<br/> <br/>Came back to add...I really loved the processing on this. The tone and muted shades are fabulous.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-03-13 16:31:53.</i></td>', 'I never did see this, but I love it! Soon, I want to start experimenting with blur. I especially love people blurred with their environment - exactly what you''ve done here. I have been so focused on trying to get my technicals down for sharp, clear pictures that that''s all I''ve thought about. Came back to add...I really loved the processing on this. The tone and muted shades are fabulous.', '2011-03-13 16:20:38.000000', '2011-03-13 16:31:53.000000', 0),
